var COMPONENTS_TASK = `Fill the prose for these components of the system. For each component return: description (what it is for in this product, 1\u20132 sentences), a description per variant (when to use it), one note per state using exactly the state names given, 2\u20136 accessibility notes (roles, keys, focus behavior), 2\u20135 "do not" rules, and up to 8 copy defaults (key/value) written in the product's domain and voice \u2014 real nouns from the brief, never "items".`;
